---
description: Stories and Code Connect files follow the component catalog contract
globs: Code/**/*.stories.*, Code/**/*.figma.*, Code/figma.config.json, Code/.storybook/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Auto-attaches when editing stories, Code Connect files, or their config. Before editing,
read `Agents/context/component-catalog.md`: each story or mapping must match its
component's row and property mapping in `Docs/Design system/Guidelines/components.md`.

Keep this rule thin: put durable guidance in `Agents/` and reference it here rather than
duplicating it.
